menu "data_matrix"

    config DATA_MATRIX_PORTS
        int "Stream ports"
        default 32
        range 2 254
        help
          The ports the switch can hold: the modules' streams and the
          providers. One place is 12 bytes on the board.

    config DATA_MATRIX_TARGETS
        int "Targets of one port"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          The ports one port's output can go to. A send copies them onto the
          sender's stack (a pointer each).

endmenu
